<h1>Help & Support</h1>
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>Are the tools really free?</h3>
<p>Yes! All tools on OnlinePDFPro are completely free to use. No hidden charges, no premium tiers, no credit card required.</p>

<h3>Do I need to sign up?</h3>
<p>No registration or signup is required. Just visit any tool page and start using it immediately.</p>

<h3>Is my data safe?</h3>
<p>All processing happens locally in your browser. your files are handled securely. We don't store, read, or share your documents.</p>

<h3>What file formats are supported?</h3>
<p>We support PDF, JPG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, HTML, and more. Each tool page lists its supported formats.</p>

<h3>Can I use these tools on mobile?</h3>
<p>Yes! All tools are fully responsive and work on any device — desktop, tablet, or smartphone.</p>
